### 1. Успешный запрос получения источников данных по счетам
# Генерирует динамический UUID через {{$uuid}} для каждого вызова
POST http://localhost:8085/get-datasoure-by-account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QVBQX0NIQU5HRVI6MTIzNDU2Nzg=

{
  "data": {
    "systemId": "APP_CHANGER",
    "requestId": "{{$uuid}}",
    "account": [
      "ACC_GPB_001",
      "ACC_GPB_002",
      "ACC_UNMAPPED_999"
    ]
  },
  "status": "Success",
  "error": null
}

### 2. Успешный запрос с явным логином и паролем
POST http://localhost:8085/get-datasoure-by-account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic APP_CHANGER 12345678

{
  "data": {
    "systemId": "APP_CHANGER",
    "requestId": "{{$uuid}}",
    "account": [
      "ACC_GPB_001",
      "ACC_GPB_002"
    ]
  },
  "status": "Success",
  "error": null
}

### 3. Проверка отказа в доступе (Неверный пароль -> 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8085/get-datasoure-by-account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic APP_CHANGER wrong_password

{
  "data": {
    "systemId": "APP_CHANGER",
    "requestId": "{{$uuid}}",
    "account": [
      "ACC_GPB_001"
    ]
  },
  "status": "Success",
  "error": null
}

### 4. Проверка валидации (Некорректный UUID -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8085/get-datasoure-by-account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QVBQX0NIQU5HRVI6MTIzNDU2Nzg=

{
  "data": {
    "systemId": "APP_CHANGER",
    "requestId": "not-a-valid-uuid",
    "account": [
      "ACC_GPB_001"
    ]
  },
  "status": "Success",
  "error": null
}

### 5. Проверка валидации (Пустой список счетов account -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8085/get-datasoure-by-account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic QVBQX0NIQU5HRVI6MTIzNDU2Nzg=

{
  "data": {
    "systemId": "APP_CHANGER",
    "requestId": "{{$uuid}}",
    "account": []
  },
  "status": "Success",
  "error": null
}
